WEBVTT

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:07.330
Chihaya-chan, pass me that cookie!

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:10.190
Haruka, where are your manners...

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:13.250
That's right...

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:16.910
We're here at "Vacation Island"!

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:19.700
This place is near my hometown!

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.320
Wow...

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.880
I wanna go to a resort, too...

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:26.640
The tea's ready, everyone.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:28.440
Hurray!

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:33.270
I'm back!

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:35.090
Welcome back!

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:38.180
Ahh, everyone's here today...

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:39.860
Perfect!

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:42.820
Oh! Is it settled, then?

00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:44.290
Yeah!

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:46.850
Vacation Island

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:48.820
Global Music Festival?

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:51.320
Huh? This island is...

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:53.840
It's the place we just saw on TV!

00:00:53.840 --> 00:01:00.860
The island is full of attractions, including an outdoor stage, a pool, a theme park...

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:02.400
Ehh...

00:01:02.090 --> 00:01:03.910
It sounds wonderful!

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:07.720
Ami and Mami wanna live out the rest of our days there!

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:09.170
Mmhmm!

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:12.360
But, why are you showing us this?

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:13.310
Ahem...

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:20.820
Actually, 765 Pro have been officially invited to this music festival!

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:25.060
Along with a 3-day, 2-night luxury trip!

00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:25.830
But...

00:01:25.830 --> 00:01:27.880
Alright!!

00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:29.870
A resort, I can't believe it!

00:01:29.870 --> 00:01:34.310
We'll be standing alongside singers from around the world, what an honor!

00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:36.990
Hey, Miki! Wake up, this is big news!

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.380
Let me sleep a bit more...

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:42.570
So when are we leaving?

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:42.560
W-Wait...

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:45.630
STOP!!

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:47.890
Well, what I was about to say is...

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:52.980
Not everyone is going to be able to go.

00:01:56.240 --> 00:02:01.400
So, the members who will be going are...

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:09.120
Alright, come in.

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:11.720
It might be a little messy...

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:16.930
It's Azusa-san's room, so it's bound to be spotless!

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:20.580
Excuse me...

00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:25.670
Please take a seat somewhere...

00:02:25.670 --> 00:02:27.750
I'll go put some tea on.

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:29.200
OK!

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:34.540
This is such a girly room, isn't it...

00:02:34.540 --> 00:02:36.020
Yeah...

00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:44.820
So milk's important after all, eh... ku!

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:48.910
But anyway...

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:52.060
I can't believe we were the ones chosen!

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:53.360
Yeah...

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:55.620
I was really surprised!

00:02:55.620 --> 00:03:01.570
But now that we have been chosen, we have to do our best on behalf of everyone, and aim to be the winners!

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:05.660
I had Producer-san choose the songs...

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:10.750
But we have to decide what sort of show we're going to put on by ourselves.

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:14.110
I guess we'll be working flat out this week...

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:18.880
Oh, Azusa-san, do you have some idea of what sort of show you'd like to go with?

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:20.280
Me?

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:22.290
Well, nothing really comes to mind...

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:24.440
What about you, Chihaya-chan?

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:27.930
I'll leave the show side of things to you...

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:29.140
Oh...

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:34.630
My problem is I've got so many ideas, I can't decide which one to choose!

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:39.240
This is so hard...

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:40.680
But...

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:46.420
To have the chance to sing in front of people from all over the world...

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:49.000
I'm so excited!

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.080
People from all over the world...

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:56.290
OK, from tomorrow, let's get to work! Yeah!

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:58.110
Yeah!

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.620
Hi, I'm back!

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:10.100
Welcome back.

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:16.320
Kotori-san, what are those three doing?

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:21.500
Actually, it looks like they can't decide what to do for their show at the festival...

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:25.930
They are the very personifications of "indecisiveness", "fascination"

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:30.240
and "indifference", aren't they...

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:39.000
Hey, thinking is important, but sometimes you just need to make a decision!

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:44.140
Please hurry up and decide, you should be prepared to use anything that's available!

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:45.510
Sorry...

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:49.560
But the more I try to decide, the more jumbled my thoughts become?

00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:52.420
Actually, now I don't think I can stop thinking...

00:04:53.010 --> 00:04:55.600
This sort of thing is all about impetus...

00:04:55.600 --> 00:05:00.160
And the Producer sure isn't lacking in that department lately!

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:03.750
Actually, about the music festival...

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:10.040
The Producer has a job he can't get out of, so he's asked me to go with you.

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:13.570
Geez... He's a real slave driver recently...

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:15.730
Umm, Ritsuko-san...

00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:20.640
You just said we could use anything, right?

00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:23.880
Huh... Wh-what?

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:27.660
That's what you said, right!?

00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:30.380
You don't mean...!

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:45.430
Waah! Ritsuko-san, look!

00:05:45.430 --> 00:05:50.190
That hotel... There's an ocean view... an ocean view!

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:51.730
It looks like a really fun place...

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:54.870
Come on, what are you saying?

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:58.120
We're here for work!

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:03.200
Umm, Ritsuko-san, we can have a little fun, right...

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:06.620
Who was it who asked me to sing at the show, again?

00:06:07.070 --> 00:06:09.620
There's no time for having fun!

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:14.130
There's so many people from so many different countries...

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:19.120
H-hey, wait...!

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:21.750
Wahh, how cute!

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:25.160
Oh my, it looks like they like you, Chihaya-chan!

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:32.550
Bye bye~

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:37.780
Candy?

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:42.400
Alright everyone, let's check out the stage!

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:46.830
The plan's all set, so let's get on with it!

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:47.840
OK!

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:56.580
It looks so big when you see it in real life...

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:59.790
We'll be able to sing here...

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:02.660
Everyone! Look!

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:05.810
Wah! Look how big we are on there!!

00:07:05.810 --> 00:07:08.740
Ahhh... I would have preferred to be small...

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:09.920
Huh!?

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:11.910
J-Jupiter!?

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:16.360
Hmm... I didn't expect to see you guys here...

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:19.360
Touma Amagase!

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:22.700
I hope you haven't forgotten me, my angels.

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:23.880
Hello!

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:26.720
So Jupiter were invited, too...

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:31.480
Obviously! We're about to start rehearsing.

00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:33.220
Can you move out of the way?

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:37.690
So you mean that whole set is for Jupiter's show!?

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:43.630
Yeah, that's right. Our show is gonna use 3D holograms!

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:45.210
With CG backing dancers that...

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:48.410
Hey, stop blabbing!

00:07:48.410 --> 00:07:49.950
Does it matter, Touma?

00:07:49.950 --> 00:07:53.130
We never run or hide, that's our style right?

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:58.590
Hmm, yeah... No running and no hiding!

00:07:58.590 --> 00:08:02.920
If you wanna watch, make sure you aren't in the way.

00:08:05.450 --> 00:08:10.480
I never thought you'd be allowed to have such a massive set...

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:12.880
It's my fault for not researching more!

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:16.190
Th-that's not true, Ritsuko-san.

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:22.130
She's right! You're only here because we suddenly asked you to come, Ritsuko-san...

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:32.310
Hmmm... We need a hard image, not a soft one...

00:08:32.310 --> 00:08:36.670
How about we expand on the theme of the song's lyrics, Ritsuko-san?

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:38.240
Vapor trails, you mean?

00:08:38.670 --> 00:08:44.770
Oh! Let's have them make smoke come out and make a vapor trail across the stage!

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:47.310
There's no way that's possible, is there?

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:49.760
Yeah, I suppose...

00:08:50.140 --> 00:08:53.000
Come on, Chihaya... help think too, please!

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:59.420
I wonder what's across the ocean...

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:02.930
Across the ocean?

00:09:08.170 --> 00:09:10.010
I'm back!

00:09:10.010 --> 00:09:12.410
Welcome back, Producer-san.

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:15.050
You were very quick, weren't you.

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:21.440
Yeah. When I thought about how hard Ritsuko and the others were working, I got a burst of energy...

00:09:22.190 --> 00:09:25.660
They're probably having a delicious meal, right now!

00:09:26.310 --> 00:09:28.250
I hope so.

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:33.120
They're all such hard workers, I'm concerned they'll be worrying too much...

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:36.580
That's true...

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:48.100
When I saw Jupiter's set...

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:50.350
I felt like something was a bit wrong.

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:51.170
Wrong...?

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:54.640
Yes... how should I put this...

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:59.440
I mean, I know that a flashy show can get the audience excited...

00:09:59.440 --> 00:10:03.110
But is that really the power of music?

00:10:03.110 --> 00:10:05.610
Chihaya-chan's right...

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:10.040
This is a music festival, so we need to express ourselves through music.

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:14.040
Indeed... We can't beat Jupiter at their own game, anyway...

00:10:15.850 --> 00:10:20.920
I think maybe we need to think of something that only we can do...

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:24.940
Something that only we can do...

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:38.090
Even if you say that, we need some sort of starting point...

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:40.740
I wonder what we should do...

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:43.020
Oh... Chihaya-chan, look, look!

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:45.800
Look at that instrument they're playing!

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:48.460
Come on Haruka, help us think!

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:55.470
Ehehehe... but since we came to this island, we haven't really done any sightseeing at all...

00:10:56.430 --> 00:10:59.640
There's people from all over the world...

00:10:59.640 --> 00:11:00.960
Well, of course...

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:02.980
It is called a "global music festival"...

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:06.100
Oh, there's the kids from the boat!

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:09.470
Ritsuko-san, I'm gonna go and have a look!

00:11:09.470 --> 00:11:11.600
Huh!? W-wait...

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:14.090
Ufufu... I'll go too, then...

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:18.900
Huh? Y-you too, Azusa-san!?

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:24.070
Ahh... and with so little time...

00:11:24.060 --> 00:11:28.110
There's so many people from different countries...

00:11:28.110 --> 00:11:31.740
They can't even talk to each other, but they're having so much fun.

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:38.200
Yeah. I suppose the good thing about music is that anyone can easily enjoy it.

00:11:38.650 --> 00:11:41.810
Hehe, Haruka and Azusa-san look like they're enjoying themselves!

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:44.990
Ahh, now they're signing along...

00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:53.090
Ritsuko, we might get an idea for the show, so let's go, too!

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:57.100
Huh? W-wait... y-you too, Chihaya!?

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:06.120
Ahh, that was so much fun!

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:09.460
Ufufu, I feel like we already finished a song!

00:12:09.460 --> 00:12:12.020
Yes, it was a good rehearsal, wasn't it...

00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:15.210
Come on! The show hasn't even started!

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:16.760
OK...

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:21.990
Hey, Chihaya-chan...

00:12:21.990 --> 00:12:23.100
What?

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:28.650
Chihaya-chan, you said you wondered
what was across the ocean, didn't you...

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:29.520
Yes...

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:35.150
Maybe across the ocean...
 there's music, just like there is here...

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:42.360
Even if the place and the people change,
 I think that's one thing that doesn't change!

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:44.640
Yes, you're right...

00:12:45.760 --> 00:12:51.240
We already have something that can be
 expressed without using words, don't we...

00:12:56.400 --> 00:13:02.260
Ufufu... We're like mailmen, delivering songs to the world!

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:04.630
Wahh, that's great!

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:09.600
Delivering songs to the world, huh?

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:14.010
That's good! Let's go with that!

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:17.330
Alright, we can't just hang around like this!

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:20.350
We have to do things our way...

00:13:20.350 --> 00:13:23.680
First of all we need to learn about the world!

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:57.660
Touma...

00:13:57.660 --> 00:14:01.400
This might be the closest place to heaven on earth...

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:04.440
Good grief. You're always thinking about that kinda thing...

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:07.200
Ahh, there they are

00:14:07.690 --> 00:14:11.080
Have they just given up completely?

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:15.800
Maybe they've lost confidence
 'cause you were picking on them yesterday, Touma...

00:14:16.090 --> 00:14:18.700
It was you who blabbed about the show!!

00:14:18.700 --> 00:14:24.090
Tsk. I thought they had a bit more backbone than that. Looks like I misjudged them!

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:36.390
Oh! Oh my, Producer-san!

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:39.350
You came!

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:41.000
Yeah...

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:45.800
A-Azusa-san, when you're that close, uhh...!

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:50.670
You're leering, Producer-san...

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:56.880
I suddenly felt kind of worried,
 so I changed my schedule...

00:14:56.880 --> 00:15:01.080
But are you all alright? Relaxing shere like this...

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:04.960
Hehe, we're fine. Just watch!

00:15:05.310 --> 00:15:06.030
Yeah!

00:15:06.030 --> 00:15:08.820
Will you join us, Producer-san?

00:15:08.820 --> 00:15:13.440
U-uhh, I... w-what's going on...?

00:15:25.680 --> 00:15:27.430
Wahh! That really suits you, Azusa-san!

00:15:28.060 --> 00:15:29.940
You look like a genuine high-school girl!

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:35.680
Oh my! You're exaggerating, Haruka-chan!

00:15:37.050 --> 00:15:40.940
Things looked like they were going really well over at Jupiter's stage...

00:15:41.490 --> 00:15:44.010
If we're gonna beat that, then...

00:15:44.010 --> 00:15:51.350
I do want to win, but maybe winning isn't our only goal.

00:15:51.520 --> 00:15:52.880
What do you mean...?

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:58.830
We just wanna deliver an amazing song to the whole world...

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:01.120
I think that's all we need to worry about!

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:08.730
That way, rather than focusing too much on the show, I think we'll be able to reach the audience better.

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:12.260
Please don't worry, Producer-dono.

00:16:12.260 --> 00:16:16.270
We spent all yesterday interacting with different people, and we received energy from them!

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:19.000
Now it's our turn to give back!

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:21.130
We're completely certain!

00:16:22.260 --> 00:16:23.950
Alright...

00:16:23.950 --> 00:16:26.540
OK, go and sing your hearts out!

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:28.400
OK!

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:38.970
Today, we're inviting you all to our world!

00:16:40.750 --> 00:16:44.960
Everyone, let's go!

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:58.880
And now, let me announce the winners...

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:02.770
The winners are...

00:19:02.770 --> 00:19:05.060
Everyone from 765 Pro!

00:19:05.060 --> 00:19:06.560
Hurray!

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:14.960
A vision of undying hope held by young girls everywhere, their show really fit the spirit of this festival perfectly.

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:17.530
Producer-san!

00:19:17.530 --> 00:19:19.300
You did it, everyone!

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:21.300
They're expecting an encore, too!

00:19:21.300 --> 00:19:24.470
Even if they asked us to repeat that...

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:26.880
There's no way we'd be able to!

00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:30.580
Well, let us help out, then!

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:36.460
Everyone!!

00:19:40.170 --> 00:19:43.490
I was so surprised, though!

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:48.330
Hehe, everyone wanted to come and support the others, so here we are!

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:53.200
If there's a party going on, I thought that everyone should be here!

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:56.670
Thank you, President, Otonashi-san...

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:58.510
Thank you for waiting!

00:19:58.910 --> 00:20:02.640
Now, let's ask everyone at 765 Pro for an encore!

00:20:03.270 --> 00:20:04.930
Encore!

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:08.010
Encore! Encore!

00:20:08.840 --> 00:20:11.620
Alright, get ready to go on stage, quickly...

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:13.940
Umm, Producer...

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:18.220
We all thought about it, and...

00:20:18.220 --> 00:20:21.160
We'd all like to sing together at the end!

00:20:22.290 --> 00:20:25.310
I see... what a good idea!

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:28.300
Nihihi... you're coming on too, you know!

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:31.160
Piyo-chan, too!!

00:20:31.650 --> 00:20:33.560
And you, President!

00:20:33.560 --> 00:20:34.670
Me too?

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:38.470
Uu-uuu! Let's all sing together!

00:20:38.470 --> 00:20:41.570
Come on, Producer-san!

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:57.120
OK, let's go! To our world of music!
